  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Localization project - Mali (2024 - 2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Localization project - Mali (2024 - 2026), focusing on WASH, CEA, FS (and possibly data transformation)</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mali Red Cross HQ, branches, specifically the Kayes branche and communities in Kayes</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mali Red Cross, HQ and branches</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the capacity of Mali Red Cross at both HQ and branch level in the sectos of WASH, CEA, FS</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WASH: CLTS. This approach focuses on sanitation behavioural change through community participation. It does this through a process of social participation.
FS: investment plan with other Movement partners</narrative>
  </description>
